- Affected when the player is resting, camping, sleeping, taking a short break,
  preparing spells, tending wounds, or recovering from fatigue or exhaustion.
- Straightforward full-night rest, short breaks, and spell preparation are still rest actions
  and should be marked affected when they change the rest state.
- Interrupted rest, long-term care, recovery from forced march, and watch rotations are also rest
  concerns because they change whether the character is actually resting and recovering.
- Watch rotations affect rest — a character on watch is not fully resting.
  Flag affected: true if the player is establishing or taking a watch shift.
